<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chrysler raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chrysler raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said Thursday analyst Michael Ward upgraded Chrysler Corp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 34-1/4.</p>
</text>
